    <!-- https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#GuidelineCombination_Alternative -->


    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#GuidelineCombination_Alternative">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#GuidelineCombinationMode"/>
        <hasDescription xml:lang="es">A cada individuo se le aplica exactamente una subpauta, seleccionada por sus condiciones de aplicación (límites de edad y/o expresiones de condición), p. ej. una dosis distinta según la edad o el peso.</hasDescription>
        <hasDescription xml:lang="en">Exactly one sub-guideline applies to each individual, selected by its applicability conditions (application age bounds and/or condition expressions), e.g. a different dose depending on age or weight.</hasDescription>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Alternativa</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Alternative</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#GuidelineCombination_Concurrent -->


    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#GuidelineCombination_Concurrent">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#GuidelineCombinationMode"/>
        <hasDescription xml:lang="en">All sub-guidelines apply at the same time (e.g. two drugs given together). Each may have its own start offset.</hasDescription>
        <hasDescription xml:lang="es">Todas las subpautas se aplican a la vez (p. ej. dos fármacos administrados juntos). Cada una puede tener su propio desfase de inicio.</hasDescription>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Concurrent</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Simultánea</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#GuidelineCombination_Sequential -->


    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#GuidelineCombination_Sequential">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#GuidelineCombinationMode"/>
        <hasDescription xml:lang="es">Las subpautas se aplican una tras otra (p. ej. inducción y después mantenimiento). El orden se indica con hasNext/hasPrevious; la primera es la subpauta sin hasPrevious. Cada paso termina al alcanzar su duración o número de aplicaciones.</hasDescription>
        <hasDescription xml:lang="en">Sub-guidelines apply one after another (e.g. induction, then maintenance). The order is given by hasNext/hasPrevious; the first one is the sub-guideline with no hasPrevious. Each step ends when its duration or count is reached.</hasDescription>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">Secuencial</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Sequential</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


